{"seq":3,"slug":"partitioning-sharding","title":"分区与分片","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/storage-engines-internals/data-organization/partitioning-sharding","wordCount":1698,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"分区与分片\">分区与分片</h1><p>一张表长到几亿行，单台机器的内存装不下它的热数据、磁盘装不下它的全部、CPU 也扫不动它的全表时，唯一的出路是把它切开。切成更小的子集叫分区，把这些子集铺到多台机器叫分片。这两个动作看似简单，却藏着分布式存储最棘手的几个问题：怎么切才不产生热点、查询怎么知道去哪台机器、扩容时数据怎么搬而不停服。这一篇把这些问题逐一摊开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>先厘清两个常被混用的词。分区（partitioning）是把一张逻辑表按某个规则切成若干物理子集（partition），它可以发生在单机内（一张大表切成多个小表文件，便于管理与裁剪）。分片（sharding）特指把这些子集分布到不同节点上，是分区在分布式层面的延伸，目标是水平扩展（scale-out）。一句话：所有分片都是分区，但分区未必跨机器。</p>\n<p>切分需要一个分区键（partition key），按它决定每条记录归属哪个分区。三种主流策略：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    KEY[分区键] --&gt; RANGE[范围分区: 按区间切]&#10;    KEY --&gt; HASH[哈希分区: 按 hash 散列]&#10;    KEY --&gt; LIST[列表分区: 按枚举值]&#10;    RANGE --&gt; R1[利于范围扫描, 易热点]&#10;    HASH --&gt; H1[分布均匀, 范围查询要广播]&#10;    LIST --&gt; L1[按业务维度如地区]\">graph TD\n    KEY[分区键] --&gt; RANGE[范围分区: 按区间切]\n    KEY --&gt; HASH[哈希分区: 按 hash 散列]\n    KEY --&gt; LIST[列表分区: 按枚举值]\n    RANGE --&gt; R1[利于范围扫描, 易热点]\n    HASH --&gt; H1[分布均匀, 范围查询要广播]\n    LIST --&gt; L1[按业务维度如地区]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>范围分区</td>\n<td>按键区间切（如按月份）</td>\n<td>范围查询只命中少数分区</td>\n<td>易出现热点（新数据全进最新分区）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>哈希分区</td>\n<td>按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h(key) \\bmod N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ey</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 散列</td>\n<td>负载均匀分布</td>\n<td>范围查询需查所有分区</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>列表分区</td>\n<td>按键的枚举值（如地区）</td>\n<td>贴合业务语义</td>\n<td>取值不均时倾斜</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"选键的艺术-热点与倾斜\">选键的艺术：热点与倾斜</h2><p>分区键选得好不好，几乎决定了系统能不能线性扩展。两个致命陷阱要避开。一是热点（hotspot）：范围分区下若用单调递增的时间戳或自增 id 当键，所有新写入永远落在「最新」那个分区/分片，写入流量全压在一台机器，其余机器空闲——扩容反而无济于事。常见解法是给键加盐（salting）或前缀打散，或干脆改用哈希分区把写入摊匀。</p>\n<p>二是倾斜（skew）：即便用哈希，如果某个键值本身访问量极高（如一个百万粉丝大 V 的用户 id），它所在的分片就会过载，这叫热键。应对要在应用层拆分（如把大 V 的数据再二级切分）或为热键单独缓存。这与 <a href=\"../foundations/buffer-pool\">缓冲池管理</a> 里的热点页问题同源，只是放到了集群尺度。</p>\n<p>我们可以用负载均衡度量化：设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个分片，第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个承载请求量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，理想是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>≈</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>q</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_i \\approx \\bar{q} = \\frac{1}{N}\\sum q_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6776em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7622em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，倾斜程度可用最大值与均值之比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>q</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max_i q_i / \\bar{q}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 衡量，理想值接近 1，越大说明越不均衡。好的分区键设计就是让这个比值贴近 1。</p>\n<h2 id=\"路由与一致性哈希\">路由与一致性哈希</h2><p>数据切开铺到多台机器后，来一个查询，怎么知道该去哪台？这就是路由问题。最朴素的取模法 <code>shard = h(key) mod N</code> 有个致命缺陷：一旦节点数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 变化（扩容/缩容），几乎所有键的归属都变了，要搬几乎全部数据——这在大集群里是灾难。</p>\n<p>一致性哈希（consistent hashing）解决了这个问题。它把哈希值空间想象成一个环，节点和键都映射到环上，每个键归属于环上顺时针方向遇到的第一个节点。增删一个节点时，只有该节点相邻区段的键需要迁移，其余不动，迁移量约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 而非全部。为避免节点在环上分布不均，实践中用虚拟节点（每个物理节点对应环上多个点）来平滑。Cassandra、DynamoDB、以及许多分布式 KV 都用此思路。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    REQ[请求 key] --&gt; H[计算 hash 落到环上某点]&#10;    H --&gt; WALK[顺时针找第一个节点]&#10;    WALK --&gt; NODE[路由到该节点的分片]&#10;    ADD[新增节点] --&gt; SPLIT[只接管相邻区段, 迁移约 1/N 数据]\">flowchart TD\n    REQ[请求 key] --&gt; H[计算 hash 落到环上某点]\n    H --&gt; WALK[顺时针找第一个节点]\n    WALK --&gt; NODE[路由到该节点的分片]\n    ADD[新增节点] --&gt; SPLIT[只接管相邻区段, 迁移约 1/N 数据]</pre><p>另一种路由是显式元数据：由一个中心组件维护「键区间 → 分片 → 节点」的映射表，查询先问元数据再定位。许多基于范围分区的系统（如 <a href=\"../advanced/modern-engines\">现代存储引擎</a> 里的 TiKV、CockroachDB）用这种「按区间切片 + 元数据路由」的方案，因为它天然支持范围查询和分片的动态分裂/合并。</p>\n<h2 id=\"再平衡-扩容时数据怎么搬\">再平衡：扩容时数据怎么搬</h2><p>集群不是一成不变的：机器会加、会坏、数据会涨。再平衡（rebalancing）就是在这些变化时把数据重新摊匀。好的再平衡要满足三条：迁移的数据量尽量少（一致性哈希、固定数量分区都为此）；迁移期间集群仍能读写（在线迁移）；不把网络/磁盘打满影响正常流量（限流）。</p>\n<p>一种工程上很稳的做法是固定数量分区：预先把数据切成远多于节点数的固定分区（如 1024 个），节点增减时只是重新分配「哪些分区归哪个节点」，而分区本身不重切——迁移粒度是整个分区，简单可控（Riak、Elasticsearch 采用）。另一种是动态分区：分区随数据量自动分裂（太大就裂成两个）与合并（太小就并），范围分区系统多用此法，让分区大小自适应数据分布。再平衡的数据搬运本质上是大量顺序读写，与 <a href=\"../advanced/write-path-compaction\">写入路径与压实</a> 里压实的 I/O 特征类似，也常需限流以免抢占前台流量。</p>\n<p>冷热分层是分区的另一应用：把很少访问的旧分区迁到更便宜的存储（如对象存储），用更高压缩级别（见 <a href=\"compression-encoding\">压缩与编码</a>），热分区留在快盘——这与 <a href=\"../foundations/storage-hierarchy\">存储层级与访问模型</a> 的金字塔在集群尺度上的回响。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>分区是把逻辑表切成物理子集，分片是把子集铺到多台机器实现水平扩展；分区键 + 策略（范围/哈希/列表）决定切法。</li>\n<li>选键要避开热点（单调键让写入全压一台，加盐或改哈希）与倾斜（热键过载，需二级拆分），用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>q</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max_i q_i/\\bar{q}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 衡量均衡度，理想接近 1。</li>\n<li>路由两条路线：一致性哈希（环 + 虚拟节点，增删节点只迁移约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>）适合哈希分区；元数据映射 + 区间切片适合范围分区与动态分裂。</li>\n<li>再平衡要少迁移、在线、限流；固定数量分区（迁移整分区）与动态分区（自动裂/并）是两种稳妥方案。</li>\n<li>冷热分层把旧分区下沉到廉价存储 + 高压缩，是 <a href=\"../foundations/storage-hierarchy\">存储层级</a> 金字塔在集群尺度的回响；具体系统形态见 <a href=\"../advanced/modern-engines\">现代存储引擎</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>数据来源：Cassandra/DynamoDB 一致性哈希与虚拟节点公开设计；《Designing Data-Intensive Applications》分区与再平衡章节的经典结论；CockroachDB/TiKV 基于范围分区与元数据路由的架构文档（2026）。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"分区与分片","id":"分区与分片"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"选键的艺术：热点与倾斜","id":"选键的艺术-热点与倾斜"},{"level":2,"text":"路由与一致性哈希","id":"路由与一致性哈希"},{"level":2,"text":"再平衡：扩容时数据怎么搬","id":"再平衡-扩容时数据怎么搬"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"压缩与编码","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/storage-engines-internals/data-organization/compression-encoding"},"next":{"title":"写入路径与压实","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/storage-engines-internals/advanced/write-path-compaction"}}